  "releaseNotes": "RunLog 3.0.0 Release Notes\n\n      Major Changes:\n      * Restructured library into multiple files for better organization\n      * Added dependency on AaTurpin.Utilities package\n      * Changed from ILogEventSink interface to concrete sink types\n      * File sinks are now buffered by default for better performance\n      * Added thread-safety via synchronization locks\n\n      New Features:\n      * Enhanced error handling with retry logic for IO issues\n      * Added fallback logging location when primary destination fails\n      * Extended support for format specifiers in log templates\n      * Improved file path handling with PathUtils\n      * Better DateTime handling for rolling intervals\n      * Public Sinks property on Logger class for inspection\n\n      Bug Fixes:\n      * Fixed issues with concurrent access to shared resources\n      * Improved message rendering with robust regex pattern matching\n      * Better handling of buffered writes with proper cleanup\n\n      Performance Improvements:\n      * Buffered file operations by default for higher throughput\n      * More efficient message queue processing\n      * Improved file rolling logic",
  "title": "RunLog",
